{"3670900": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Minute Man", "steam_appid": 3670900, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze time and defeat your enemies!</strong> Minute Man is a 2D beat 'em up platformer where you can freeze time as you're fighting  to secure an advantage. Fight through various waves of enemies and defeat bosses in seven levels, keeping time frozen as you chain combos against your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670900/extras/f9bb8afe6051e9e09e09b7146101599d.poster.avif?t=1787988903\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670900/extras/f9bb8afe6051e9e09e09b7146101599d.webm?t=1787988903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670900/extras/f9bb8afe6051e9e09e09b7146101599d.mp4?t=1787988903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze time</strong> as you fight your enemies! In each level, you have a limited number of time freezes available for use at any time.  Time stays frozen for three seconds by default, with the timer pausing as you land hits; therefore, you will want to stay on the attack even while time is frozen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build combos and killstreaks</strong> as you continue your attack, building your score as you speed through waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight seven clans</strong> in seven levels, each with several waves of enemies and a boss to defeat. Each clan has unique methods and tools for combat, so be prepared!</p></li></ul>", "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze time and defeat your enemies!</strong> Minute Man is a 2D beat 'em up platformer where you can freeze time as you're fighting  to secure an advantage. Fight through various waves of enemies and defeat bosses in seven levels, keeping time frozen as you chain combos against your enemies!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670900/extras/f9bb8afe6051e9e09e09b7146101599d.poster.avif?t=1787988903\" width=1170 height=658 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670900/extras/f9bb8afe6051e9e09e09b7146101599d.webm?t=1787988903\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3670900/extras/f9bb8afe6051e9e09e09b7146101599d.mp4?t=1787988903\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Features:</p><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Freeze time</strong> as you fight your enemies! In each level, you have a limited number of time freezes available for use at any time.  Time stays frozen for three seconds by default, with the timer pausing as you land hits; therefore, you will want to stay on the attack even while time is frozen!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Build combos and killstreaks</strong> as you continue your attack, building your score as you speed through waves of enemies.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Fight seven clans</strong> in seven levels, each with several waves of enemies and a boss to defeat. Each clan has unique methods and tools for combat, so be prepared!</p></li></ul>", "short_description": "Freeze time and defeat your enemies! Minute Man is a 2D beat 'em up platformer where you can freeze time as you're fighting to secure an advantage. Fight through various waves of enemies and defeat bosses in seven levels, ke